<section class="home-intro">
  <p class="eyebrow">COLOR / Personal Blog</p>
  <h1 class="home-wordmark" aria-label="COLORFULIFE">
    <span class="wordmark-fill">COLORFU</span><span class="wordmark-white">L</span><span class="wordmark-fill wordmark-life">IFE</span>
  </h1>
  <p class="intro-text">这里会慢慢放下电子信息工程的笔记、PCB 设计、课程复盘，也会放摄影、模型和日常。页面尽量安静，让文字和作品自己说话。</p>
  <div class="intro-actions">
    <a class="button primary" href="<%- url_for('/notes/') %>">进入笔记</a>
    <a class="button ghost" href="<%- url_for('/life/') %>">生活记录</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bento-grid" aria-label="site sections">
  <a class="bento-card bento-large" href="<%- url_for('/notes/') %>">
    <span class="card-kicker">Notes</span>
    <strong>学习笔记</strong>
    <small>电路、信号与系统、通信原理、嵌入式、C++、Python、数学建模与 LaTeX。</small>
  </a>

  <a class="bento-card" href="<%- url_for('/pcb/') %>">
    <span class="card-kicker">Board</span>
    <strong>PCB 设计</strong>
    <small>原理图、封装、布局布线、打样、焊接和调试。</small>
  </a>

  <a class="bento-card" href="<%- url_for('/links/') %>">
    <span class="card-kicker">Links</span>
    <strong>常用入口</strong>
    <small>开发工具、芯片资料、硬件参考和后续会反复用到的网站。</small>
  </a>

  <a class="bento-card bento-tall" href="<%- url_for('/life/') %>">
    <span class="card-kicker">Life</span>
    <strong>生活与作品</strong>
    <small>摄影、模型、旅行、随笔，以及不必归进课程表里的东西。</small>
  </a>
</section>

<section class="content-grid">
  <div class="section-main">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Writing</p>
      <h2>最近记录</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="post-list">
      <% site.posts.sort('date', -1).limit(6).forEach(function(post) { %>
        <a class="post-card" href="<%- url_for(post.path) %>">
          <time datetime="<%= post.date.format('YYYY-MM-DD') %>"><%= post.date.format('YYYY.MM.DD') %></time>
          <h3><%= post.title %></h3>
          <p><%= strip_html(post.excerpt || post.content).replace(/\s+/g, ' ').substring(0, 118) %></p>
        </a>
      <% }) %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <aside class="side-index">
    <div class="section-heading compact">
      <p class="eyebrow">Index</p>
      <h2>入口</h2>
    </div>
    <nav class="rail-nav" aria-label="Index links">
      <a class="rail-link" href="<%- url_for('/about/') %>">
        <span class="rail-kicker">Profile</span>
        <strong>关于我和这个站点</strong>
        <small>方向与说明。</small>
      </a>
      <a class="rail-link" href="<%- url_for('/archives/') %>">
        <span class="rail-kicker">Archive</span>
        <strong>按时间查看全部文章</strong>
        <small>按日期回看。</small>
      </a>
      <a class="rail-link" href="<%- url_for('/links/') %>">
        <span class="rail-kicker">Toolkit</span>
        <strong>常用链接与工具</strong>
        <small>资料与工具。</small>
      </a>
    </nav>
  </aside>
</section>
